s 调度器 (`default-scheduler`) 在尝试调度时发现没有节点满足该选择条件，从而持续返回 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` 的错误信息 [证据 #1]。由于该配置存在于 Pod 的 Spec 中，除非移除或修正该选择器，否则 Pod 将一直无法被调度，表现为 `Pending` 状态 [证据 #2, #5]。资源限制与请求配置极低 [证据 #3, #4]，排除了资源不足的可能性，进一步确认根因为标签选择器不匹配。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 47.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52: 47.4s (Evidence 40.0s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 80.846, "metrics": {"run_id": "f8b6bf227de84e15", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 80.85325312614441, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 80853.25312614441, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 77284.5196723938, "tool_calls": 8, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 8, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7231.324911117554, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3245.035409927368}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 20708.779335021973, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 47370.74851989746, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12751.75666809082, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

